1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,980
Nanna knew how AI works.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:02,730
(and she never saw a computer)

3
00:00:02,750 --> 00:00:03,980
7 Maltese proverbs that explain AI

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:04,980
Proverb 7

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,980
“Drop by drop, the jar fills.”

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,230
And AI? That is how it learns: word by word,

7
00:00:09,250 --> 00:00:11,480
trillions of times.

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,980
Proverb 6

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,980
“Search a head closely and you will know what is in it.”

10
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,230
And AI? Not even its builders know exactly what is inside.

11
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,480
So scientists are combing through its brain.

12
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,980
Proverb 5

13
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,980
“A hasty cat gives birth to blind kittens.”

14
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,380
And AI? How many R’s are in “Għargħur”?

15
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:26,230
A rushed answer? Often wrong.

16
00:00:26,250 --> 00:00:27,480
Today’s best models stop and think.

17
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:28,980
Proverb 4

18
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:30,980
“Give the job to whoever knows how to do it.”

19
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,230
And AI? It does the same:

20
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,480
every job to the right tool.

21
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:36,980
Proverb 3

22
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,980
“Your neighbour teaches you how to keep house.”

23
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:41,230
And AI? Show it an example…

24
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:43,480
…and it does the same. (rabbit → rabbits)

25
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:44,980
Proverb 2

26
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,980
“A liar’s life is short.”

27
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,080
And AI? Sometimes it makes things up — with full confidence.

28
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,480
NOT TRUE. It is called a “hallucination”.

29
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:51,480
Always check.

30
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,980
Proverb 1

31
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:54,980
“With kind words you get everywhere.”

32
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:57,480
And AI? Today, words command machines.

33
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,230
And Maltese? Words too.

34
00:00:58,250 --> 00:00:59,980
Talk to it in Maltese.

35
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:00,980
Nanna knew.

36
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,480
Which proverb did we forget? Tell us in the comments.

37
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:03,980
Nanna knew…
